 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_op_crownfall_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_op_crownfall_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "This is the Crownfall. Every record your campaign kept is now load-bearing. We advised exact phrasing from the beginning; today you learn why.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 182,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_op_crownfall_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_op_mara_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_op_mara_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_mara_vey",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "operations_radio",
   "source_text": "Witness station one, standing. I spent fifteen operations making uncertainty governable. I am here to watch what that bought, not to steer it.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 182,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_op_mara_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_op_oruun_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_op_oruun_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_oruun_seven_stones",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "cross_faction_radio",
   "source_text": "Witness station two. My accounts have argued the whole way here, and they have agreed to watch the ending together. All seven. That has never happened.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 191,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_op_oruun_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_op_talar_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_op_talar_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "operations_radio",
   "source_text": "The public record is open and I will keep it faithfully. Whatever is selected, the register will say what was done, by whom, under which earned eligibility. Nothing more, and absolutely nothing less.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 239,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_op_talar_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_approach_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_approach_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_approach_secured",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The Approach Anchor is bound and irreversible. The Crownfall accepts that we intend to finish. From here, intent is a structural property.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 178,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_approach_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_approach_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_approach_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_approach_secured",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Assemble the accords: Possible at the Meridian site, Manifest at the Kharuun site, myself at ours. Three form languages, one frame, as the sky prefers it.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 194,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_approach_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_accord_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_accord_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_accord_assembled",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The accord stands assembled and witnessed. Every faction's shape is present; none is subordinated. The eligible endings are now readable at the archive.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 192,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_accord_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_accord_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_accord_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_accord_assembled",
   "delivery_channel": "operations_radio",
   "source_text": "Confirmed from the record: your earned subset is displayed exactly as the ledger supports it. Read all of it before selecting. Selection is confirmed twice and cannot be unsaid.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 217,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_accord_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_restoration_a",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_restoration_a",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Restoration. The held futures return to the ground they were taken from, and the Wells begin giving back. What was deferred will wake to a different arithmetic.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 200,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_restoration_a",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_restoration_b",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_restoration_b",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The conduit rises at the northern convergence. The hold is the longest but one — what returns, returns slowly, and must be guarded the whole way.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 185,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_restoration_b",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_stabilization_a",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_stabilization_a",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Controlled Stabilization. The Crownfall is held at its current pitch — no restoration, no collapse, a managed wound. It is the ending that asks the least and promises the same.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 216,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_stabilization_a",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_stabilization_b",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_stabilization_b",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The conduit rises at the central convergence. The base hold, no more. Stability is the one future that arrives on schedule.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 163,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_stabilization_b",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_extinguishment_a",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_extinguishment_a",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Extinguishment. The remaining held futures are spent to close the Crownfall for good. The sky stops arguing. So does everything that argued through it.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 191,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_extinguishment_a",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_extinguishment_b",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_extinguishment_b",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The conduit rises at the western convergence. Hold it firmly. An ending that silences deserves to be watched every tick of the way down.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 176,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_extinguishment_b",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_evolution_a",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_evolution_a",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Open Evolution. The Crownfall is released to continue becoming, unmanaged, with everything that implies and nothing that guarantees. We find this one difficult to phrase. That is the point of it.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 235,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m15_vo_evolution_a",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m15_line_evolution_b",
   "loc_key": "nar_m15_line_evolution_b",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m15_evt_resolution_selected",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The conduit rises at the southwestern convergence, and the hold is the longest of the four. What is being released takes its time deciding what it is.",
   "placeholders": {},
